# Linear A <-> B with the conserved total A + B = 1 left in the ODEs (issue #15); steady state A = 2/3, B = 1/3
SOLVER CSSS
STARTING_TIME 0.0
ENDING_TIME 1.0
RELATIVE_TOLERANCE 1.0E-9
ABSOLUTE_TOLERANCE 1.0E-12
STEADY_STATE TRUE
RESOLUTION 1e-9
MAX_NEWTON_ITERATIONS 50
MAXIMUM_FORWARD_DURATION 1e9
DERIVATION_FACTOR 0.001
STOP_CRITERIA DISTANCE_AND_RATE
NUM_EQUATIONS 2
ODE A INIT 1.0;
	 RATE ((-1.0 * A) + (2.0 * B));
ODE B INIT 0.0;
	 RATE (A - (2.0 * B));
